    <pubDate>Tue, 27 Aug 2024 04:37:43 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>-本期嘉宾-</span></p><span></span><p><span>十三 &nbsp;&nbsp;先后于两家国企工作过，资深文学爱好者</span></p><span></span><p><span>-精彩内容-</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="98">01:38</a> &nbsp;国企员工年龄层会偏大吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="170">02:50</a> 国企培养人才（升职）的两条路径</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="246">04:06</a> 国企员工与公务员的区别？可以身份转化吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="381">06:21</a> 国企晋升技巧：哄领导开心的“一技之长”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="551">09:11</a> 做人精的技巧：和领导吵架也是一种生存战略</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="967">16:07</a> 国企的企业培训比较缺失</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1498">24:58</a> 国企到底“香”在那儿？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2067">34:27</a> 为什么选择待在稳定的国企？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2733">45:33</a> 国企的弊端：出了问题大家一起“藏”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3114">51:54</a> 质检不过关，为什么不投钱换设备？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3662">61:02</a> 国企人的被迫养老生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4233">70:33</a> 包分配！在国企不愁找男（女）朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span>-主播介绍-</span></p><span></span><p><span>🐸蛙蛙 日本外资公司打工人（社会人1年目）</span></p><span></span><p><span>合作联系：guorui0925@gmail.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书id：ink0106330</span></p><span></span><p><span>🐰U-YI 东京大学教育学ongoing</span></p><span></span><p><span>合作联系：yui.faith97@gmail.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书id：yuifaith97</span></p>]]></description>
