  <item>
    <title>EP10｜小镇做题家，在日读博，为什么后悔呢</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/669cc79b37236c546ea27ab5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">669cc79b37236c546ea27ab5</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 21 Jul 2024 08:32:26 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>-本期嘉宾-</span></p><span></span><p><span>胡椒粉同学</span></p><span></span><p><span>东京大学 生物信息学 博士在读</span></p><span></span><p><span>-精彩瞬间-</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="262">04:22</a></span></strong><span> 为什么后悔来日本留学呢？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="353">05:53</a></span></strong><span> 文科博士VS 理科博士</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="733">12:13</a> </span></strong><span>&nbsp;高考大省的小镇做题家 VS 其他地区</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="975">16:15</a> 内高班 是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1771">29:31</a></span></strong><span> 留学生 不可避免的孤独问题</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1987">33:07</a></span></strong><span> 会有人为学习如何社交而付费吗？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2760">46:00</a></span></strong><span> 从生物学角度解读“女性的被社交”</span></p><span></span><p><span>-知识卡片-</span></p><span></span><p><span>内高班</span></p><span></span><p><span>内地新疆高中班(内高班)是指选拔新疆的优秀应届初中毕业生到中、东部发达地区就读高中，利用发达地区的经济、教育优势提高新疆各族学生受教育质量的一种跨文化、跨区域的合作办学模式。</span></p><span></span><p><span>-主播介绍-</span></p><span></span><p><span>🐸蛙蛙 日本外资公司打工人（社会人1年目）</span></p><span></span><p><span>合作联系：guorui0925@gmail.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书id：ink0106330</span></p><span></span><p><span>🐰U-YI 东京大学教育学ongoing</span></p><span></span><p><span>合作联系：yui.faith97@gmail.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书id：yuifaith97</span></p>]]></description>
