  <item>
    <title>EP09｜Emmmm 交友APP有什么错呢....🥹</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/667d6b1bc13b46d76c512b95</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">667d6b1bc13b46d76c512b95</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 27 Jun 2024 13:37:31 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>-本期嘉宾-</span></p><span></span><p><span>小缸</span></p><span></span><p><span>国内美妆大厂女工一枚</span></p><span></span><p><span>-精彩瞬间-</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="182">03:02</a></span></strong><span> 市面上的dating app有哪些？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="338">05:38</a></span></strong><span> 用算法匹配的对象到底是高效还是低效</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="526">08:46</a></span></strong><span> 为什么使用dating app后有一种很强的被物化的感觉</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="856">14:16</a></span></strong><span> 通过dating app交友，是一种孤独者的互相“吸血”？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="902">15:02</a></span></strong><span> 交友软件的不为人知的妙用！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1263">21:03</a></span></strong><span> 想用又害怕？“过来人”给你一些经验分享和约会Tips</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1783">29:43</a></span></strong><span> 想要拥有亲密关系，但又抗拒依赖</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2152">35:52</a></span></strong><span> 什么是夏令营效应</span></p><span></span><p><span>-知识卡片-</span></p><span></span><p><span>夏令营效应</span></p><span></span><p><span>指的是短暂热烈而注定结束的亲密关系。 就像去某个陌生城市参加夏令营，你会偶然间闯入别人的人生，建立短暂而强烈的情感连接。 这样的关系很难维持，当夏令营结束之后，你们相处的理由就消失了，最终还是要回到自己原来的生活中。</span></p><span></span><p><span>-主播介绍-</span></p><span></span><p><span>🐸蛙蛙 日本外资公司打工人（社会人1年目）</span></p><span></span><p><span>商务合作：guorui0925@gmail.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书id：630773848</span></p><span></span><p><span>🐰U-YI 东京大学教育学ongoing</span></p><span></span><p><span>商务合作：yui.faith97@gmail.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书id：yuifaith97</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lhPgoJZEBDDrc90FhulQWVk35Irr.m4a" length="37474884" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:38:37</itunes:duration>
