    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期无嘉宾-</span></p><span></span><p><span>-Time Line-</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="61">01:01</a> 从学生到社会人：压力小了，自由也少了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="204">03:24</a> 在家远程办公：很难区分生活和工作空间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="333">05:33</a> 有得有失：“还是上学好呀”，但看到工资条还是很开心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="428">07:08</a> 升入修士二年级，突入其来的留学孤独</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="587">09:47</a> 决定读博的各种小纠结</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="868">14:28</a> 高投入低回报的职业：学者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="974">16:14</a> 学术圈的业绩主义和日本学阀圈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1306">21:46</a> 在日工作如何“防止孤独与社交”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1635">27:15</a> 在国外生活，我们始终是边缘群体</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1918">31:58</a> 小组讨论时，放弃当mood maker后，很爽！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2148">35:48</a> 工作幸福度决定因素：职场氛围适配度（push/舒缓） 、直系领导</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2427">40:27</a> 外资vs日企：就业时要根据自己的个性选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2546">42:26</a> 谬论：工作就是无聊的、不开心的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2814">46:54</a>外国人在日本职场有什么优势？为什么企业需要global talent？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3017">50:17</a> 关于technical sales这个职业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3380">56:20</a> 万物皆销售，销售是个万金油的方法论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3493">58:13</a> 在日本升职为啥对外国人来说难？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3682">61:22</a> 认识自己之后，才会对未来的方向更加清晰</span></p><span></span><p><span>-