    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>-本期嘉宾-</span></p><span></span><p><span>田田 北大本科+东京大学硕士</span></p><span></span><p><span>-时间轴-</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="106">01:46</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;IFTP人格 嘉宾自我介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="227">03:47</a>为什么现在的家长对于孩子成功的执念如此之强？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="352">05:52</a> 不付出努力就可以取得成功？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="440">07:20</a>短平快不仅荼毒孩子？也荼毒家长</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="478">07:58</a> 在K12教育中 家长到底扮演什么角色</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="515">08:35</a> 家长疯狂干预 到底是为什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="733">12:13</a> 高中阶段想要取得好成绩，什么更重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="852">14:12</a> 为什么总想走捷径</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="973">16:13</a> 小道消息 早稻田很好考？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1234">20:34</a> 北大的光环带来的好处和坏处</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1560">26:00</a> 因为是名校学生，有受到过来自外界的期待吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1740">29:00</a> 日本教授普遍放养？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2220">37:00</a> 名校光环到底带来了什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2581">43:01</a> 孩子不跟家长沟通会加剧家长的焦虑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3012">50:12</a> 在不内耗的路上越走越远的秘诀是 玄学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3328">55:28</a> 要更多的专注于自己的优势和强项</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3493">58:13</a> 不追求自己做不到的事情，是非常好的人生心态</span></p><span></span><p><span>-互动联系-</span></p><span></span><p><span>🐸蛙蛙 东京大学经济学M2（即将毕业！）</span></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱：guorui0925@gmail.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书id：630773848</span></p><span></span><p><span>U-YI 东京大学教育学M1</span></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱：yui.faith97@gmail.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书id：yuifaith97</span></p>]]></description>
